  "body": "## Summary\n- In Heidenhain DIN/ISO post (heidenhain.cps), write G04 F<s> for every dwell at bottom.\n- Remove FUNCTION DWELL from DIN/ISO post (FUNCTION DWELL is valid only in Klartext mode).\n- Update test cases in heidenhain_block_form.rs and heidenhain_cycles.rs to assert G04 F across controllers (Fehlmann iTNC 530, TNC 640 older and newer versions, spaced NC strings, unknown models, and default machine with no identity).\n\n## Verification\n- cargo test -p camcraft-post --test heidenhain_block_form --test heidenhain_cycles (17 passed, 0 failed)\n- cargo clippy -p camcraft-post --all-targets -- -D warnings (clean)\n\nChangelog: In Heidenhain DIN/ISO post, write G04 F for all dwells and remove unsupported FUNCTION DWELL\n\nFixes #4093",
